# a button held with a key or a knob is a combo: on release its own tap (its page, the EDIT list) does not follow
wait 300
tap SAVE
wait 100
tapkey w4
wait 200
press HOME
tapkey b0
release HOME
wait 100
tap FX
wait 200
expect page 2
# every button: held + a white key, released: the page stays
press LFO
tapkey w6
release LFO
wait 100
expect page 2
press EDIT
tapkey w2
release EDIT
wait 100
expect page 2
press SAVE
tapkey w6
release SAVE
wait 100
expect page 2
press ARP
tapkey w3
release ARP
wait 100
expect page 2
press GLO
tapkey w3
release GLO
wait 100
expect page 2
press ENV
tapkey w2
release ENV
wait 100
expect page 2
press HOME
tapkey w2
release HOME
wait 100
expect page 2
# held + a knob
press LFO
turn K1 1
release LFO
wait 100
expect page 2
press EDIT
turn K2 1
release EDIT
wait 100
expect page 2
press SAVE
turn K1 1
release SAVE
wait 100
expect page 2
press GLO
turn K1 1
release GLO
wait 100
expect page 2
press ENV
turn K1 1
release ENV
wait 100
expect page 2
press ARP
turn K1 1
release ARP
wait 100
expect page 2
press HOME
turn K1 1
release HOME
wait 100
expect page 2
# on TRACKS: EDIT + a white key must not open the EDIT list (the list is for a tap)
page 11
wait 200
expect layview 0
press LFO
tapkey w6
release LFO
wait 100
expect layview 0
press LFO
turn SELECT 1
release LFO
wait 100
expect layview 0
expect page 11
shot combo_tracks.png
tap LFO
wait 100
expect layview 1
tap LFO
wait 100
expect layview 0
# still the plain taps work: a tap on EDIT, FX, GLO changes the page
tap FX
wait 100
expect page 2
tap GLO
wait 100
expect page 9
tap FX
wait 100
expect page 2
# hold EDIT without a combo is still UNDO; the hint still shows
press LFO
wait 900
release LFO
wait 100
expect page 2
